      "category": "Delivery",
      "spanish": "Creo que tiene la dirección equivocada",
      "english": "I think you have the wrong address",
      "pronunciation": "KREH-oh keh tee-EH-neh lah dee-rehk-see-OHN eh-kee-voh-KAH-dah",
      "context": "Correcting delivery error",
      "cultural_note": "Common issue with inconsistent addressing",
      "alternative": "Esta no es mi dirección"
    },
